# Alles ignorieren
*

# Nur diese explizit erlauben
!src/
!src/**
!webflasher/
!webflasher/**
!.github/
!.github/**
!images/
!images/**
# Re-excluded after the whitelist above: macOS drops .DS_Store into any folder
# opened in Finder, and Affinity leaves a lock file next to an open document.
# Without these lines both would show up as commit candidates. The .DS_Store
# rule is global rather than per folder, because the whitelist un-ignores the
# file in every directory it covers - it turned up in src/ next.
**/.DS_Store
images/*~lock~
!platformio.ini
!partitions.csv
!copy_release.py
!manifest.json
!version.json
!README.md
!BUILDING.md
!REFACTOR_PLAN.md
!index.html
!.gitignore
